# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MedLoop AI — Git attributes
#
# Two jobs:
#   1. Route the third-party PAD-UFES-20 clinical images through Git LFS.
#   2. Keep everything else — including this project's own artwork — in
#      normal Git, so it does not consume the account's LFS storage quota.
#
# ORDER MATTERS. Later rules win, so the LFS rule is deliberately the last
# rule that touches PNG files.
#
# Git LFS must be installed and initialised BEFORE the first `git add` of any
# path matched below. If the clean filter is not active, Git silently stores
# the raw bytes instead of a pointer:
#
#     git lfs install
#     git check-attr filter -- Dataset/images/imgs_part_1/PAT_8_15_820.png
#     # expected output: "... filter: lfs"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. Repo-wide binary handling ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never newline-convert these, never attempt a text diff.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.safetensors binary

# ── 2. Text files: normalise to LF in the repository ─────────────────────────
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.ts    text eol=lf
*.tsx   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.jsx   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.sql   text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.csv   text eol=lf

# ── 3. Git LFS — dataset images only ─────────────────────────────────────────
# PNG is the only image format present in Dataset/ (2,298 files, verified).
# Adding a new image format to the dataset requires adding a line here, or it
# will be committed as a raw blob into normal Git history.
Dataset/**/*.png  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ── 4. Deliberately NOT in Git LFS ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Dataset/metadata.csv is 316 KB of plain text. It stays in normal Git so that
# any change to a label or a clinical field is visible in a reviewable diff.
Dataset/metadata.csv  text eol=lf

# Project artwork at the repository root (medloopai_logo.png,
# favicon_medloop_ai.png — ~0.9 MB each) is matched by rule 1 only, not by
# rule 3, so it stays in normal Git.

# ── 5. Linguist hints — keep the dataset out of the language statistics ──────
Dataset/**    linguist-vendored
Dataset/**    linguist-generated=false
